---
title: ":tropical_drink: Frozen Bikini"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 1
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 0 minutes
total time: 5 minutes
tags:
  - beverages
  - cocktail
  - frozen
  - alcoholic
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #blender{}, combine @vodka{2%oz}, @peach schnapps{1%oz}, @orange juice{2%oz}, @peach nectar{3%oz}, a splash of @lemon juice{1%splash}, and @crushed ice{4%oz}.

Blend until smooth and slushy.

Pour into a chilled #goblet{} and top with chilled @champagne{1%oz}.
